#. normal_region.csv: Located in the center of the continent, with fl...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_101_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the center of the continent, with flat terrain and peaceful "
"spiritual qi. An ideal place for beginners to build a foundation and "
"establish sects."

#. normal_region.csv: Plains Region
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_101_NAME"
msgstr "Plains Region"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the far west of the continent, a vas...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_102_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the far west of the continent, a vast desert with yellow sand "
"filling the sky. The climate is dry with a huge temperature difference "
"between day and night, a mandatory route for desert caravans."

#. normal_region.csv: Western Quicksand
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_102_NAME"
msgstr "Western Quicksand"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the southwest of the continent, with...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_103_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the southwest of the continent, with ancient trees reaching the "
"sky and vines entangling. The forest is dense with many wild beasts, a "
"dangerous place for gathering medicinal herbs and hunting."

#. normal_region.csv: Southern Wilds
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_103_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Wilds"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the far north of the continent, froz...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_104_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the far north of the continent, frozen for thousands of miles and"
" unchanging for ten thousand years. It is bone-chillingly cold with wind and"
" snow; only the most resilient adventurers can survive here."

#. normal_region.csv: Far North Ice Field
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_104_NAME"
msgstr "Far North Ice Field"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the far east of the continent, vast ...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_105_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the far east of the continent, vast and boundless with surging "
"waves. The wind and waves are treacherous with hidden reefs; it is a sea of "
"challenge for maritime merchants and fishermen."

#. normal_region.csv: Boundless Azure Sea
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_105_NAME"
msgstr "Boundless Azure Sea"

#. normal_region.csv: Traverses the continent from east to west, a ri...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_106_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Traverses the continent from east to west, a river of spring water flowing "
"east, rushing endlessly into the East Sea. This river cuts across east and "
"west with rapid flow, serving as an important transportation route."

#. normal_region.csv: Tianhe River Flow
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_106_NAME"
msgstr "Tianhe River Flow"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the east of the continent, undulatin...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_107_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the east of the continent, undulating and piercing into the "
"clouds. The mountains are steep with many strange stones and caves, a "
"popular place for adventurers to find treasures."

#. normal_region.csv: Qingfeng Mountains
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_107_NAME"
msgstr "Qingfeng Mountains"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the northwest of the continent, with...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_108_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the northwest of the continent, with snowy peaks and bone-"
"chilling winds. Shrouded in snow all year round with rugged mountain paths, "
"the ultimate challenge for climbers."

#. normal_region.csv: Ten Thousand Zhang Snow Peak
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_108_NAME"
msgstr "Ten Thousand Zhang Snow Peak"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the west of the continent, with lush...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_109_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the west of the continent, with lush grass stretching as far as "
"the eye can see. The water and grass are abundant with herds of cattle and "
"sheep, a natural pasture for nomadic peoples."

#. normal_region.csv: Thousands of Miles of Green Fields
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_109_NAME"
msgstr "Thousands of Miles of Green Fields"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the center of the continent, with an...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_110_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the center of the continent, with ancient trees reaching the sky "
"and vibrant greenery. The forest is vast and rich in resources, a main "
"activity area for loggers and hunters."

#. normal_region.csv: Qingyun Forest Sea
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_110_NAME"
msgstr "Qingyun Forest Sea"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the northeast of the continent, with...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_111_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the northeast of the continent, with flames reaching the sky and "
"magma flowing. The volcano is active with abundant geothermal energy, an "
"ideal place for blacksmiths to forge, but also extremely dangerous."

#. normal_region.csv: Lava Volcano
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_111_NAME"
msgstr "Lava Volcano"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the east of the continent, with fert...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_112_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the east of the continent, with fertile land and abundant crops. "
"The soil is deep and rain is plentiful, a golden treasure land for farmers "
"to cultivate."

#. normal_region.csv: Fertile Farmland
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_112_NAME"
msgstr "Fertile Farmland"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the south of the continent, shrouded...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_113_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the south of the continent, shrouded in five-colored miasma all "
"year round with poisonous insects everywhere. Mortals dissolve into bones "
"upon entry; only those practicing poisonous techniques view this as a "
"supreme grotto-heaven."

#. normal_region.csv: Underworld Poisonous Swamp
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_113_NAME"
msgstr "Underworld Poisonous Swamp"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the south of the continent, vast mou...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_114_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the south of the continent, vast mountains stretching endlessly, "
"the ancestral land of the Yao tribe. The mountains are steep and the roads "
"are difficult to traverse."

#. normal_region.csv: One Hundred Thousand Mountains
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_114_NAME"
msgstr "One Hundred Thousand Mountains"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the north-central continent, with pu...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_115_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the north-central continent, with purple bamboo forming forests "
"and clear spiritual qi. The wind through the forest sounds like immortal "
"music; quiet cultivation here can cleanse heart demons and comprehend the "
"Dao of heaven and earth."

#. normal_region.csv: Purple Bamboo Secluded Realm
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_115_NAME"
msgstr "Purple Bamboo Secluded Realm"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the northeast of the continent, wher...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_116_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the northeast of the continent, where no grass grows and the "
"permafrost is a thousand feet deep. Life is extinguished here, yet it "
"contains the ultimate cold spiritual qi, with ten-thousand-year profound ice"
" occasionally appearing."

#. normal_region.csv: Freezing Frost Wasteland
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_116_NAME"
msgstr "Freezing Frost Wasteland"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the southwest of the continent, with...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_117_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the southwest of the continent, with flying sand and stones and "
"wind as sharp as a knife. Legend has it that stars once fell here, and "
"violent star power and extraterrestrial meteoric iron still remain."

#. normal_region.csv: Shattered Star Gobi
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_117_NAME"
msgstr "Shattered Star Gobi"

#. normal_region.csv: Located in the far eastern overseas, hanging al...
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_118_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Located in the far eastern overseas, hanging alone overseas and shrouded in "
"clouds. Spiritual springs gush on the island, with strange flowers and herbs"
" everywhere, and spiritual qi density far exceeding the mainland, a place "
"yearned for by overseas rogue cultivators."

#. normal_region.csv: Penglai Lost Island
msgid "NORMAL_REGION_118_NAME"
msgstr "Penglai Lost Island"
